# Tubidy

> Tubidy is a music download website that helps users search for songs, artists, and music videos and access available MP3 and MP4 formats through a simple interface.

Tubidy's canonical website is [https://tubidy.llc/](https://tubidy.llc/). Its primary language is English, with a focus on South African music discovery.

## Core functions

- [Search music, artists, songs, and music video titles](https://tubidy.llc/)
- Review individual music or video results before choosing an available format.
- Access MP3 audio and MP4 video options when provided for a selected result.
- Browse music trends, moods, genres, and South African selections.

## Key pages

- [Article archive](https://tubidy.llc/article/): Native editorial articles about music search, music discovery, and available download formats.
- [About and editorial transparency](https://tubidy.llc/page/about/): Service identity, editorial approach, corrections, and responsible-use information.
- [Frequently asked questions](https://tubidy.llc/page/faq/): Answers about using Tubidy search and available formats.
- [Terms](https://tubidy.llc/page/terms/): Terms governing use of the website.
- [DMCA process](https://tubidy.llc/page/dmca/): Copyright notification process.
- [Contact](https://tubidy.llc/page/contact/): Contact information for Tubidy.

## Content and citation notes

- Search and download result pages are dynamic and can change as source availability changes.
- File format, quality, size, and availability should be verified on the selected result page.
- Editorial articles are stored as native files and expose published and modified dates.
- Users are responsible for following applicable copyright law and obtaining permission where required.
